    <button class="folder-link" @click="search='Sains';nav('library')"><span class="folder-dot dot-green"></span>Sains & alam <span>4</span></button>
    <button class="folder-link" @click="search='Indonesia';nav('library')"><span class="folder-dot dot-orange"></span>Geografi <span>3</span></button>
    <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="help-card"><div class="help-icon"><CircleHelp :size="17"/></div><b>Perlu bantuan?</b><p>Pelajari cara membuat kuis pertamamu.</p><button @click="ping('Panduan Ruang Kuis')">Buka panduan <ArrowRight :size="14"/></button></div><button class="profile-row" @click="openAuth"><div class="profile-avatar">{{authUser?.email?.slice(0,2).toUpperCase()||'RN'}}</div><div class="profile-copy"><b>{{authUser?.email||'Rani Nugraha'}}</b><small>{{authUser?'Akun Supabase':'Masuk / daftar'}}</small></div><MoreHorizontal :size="18"/></button></div>
  </aside>
  <main class="main-area" :class="{'public-main':page==='landing','player-main':page==='player'}">
