</b></span></footer></section>
    <header v-else-if="page!=='player'" class="topbar"><button class="mobile-menu" @click="showMobile=!showMobile" aria-label="Buka menu"><Menu :size="20"/></button><div class="breadcrumbs"><span>Kelas Kita</span><span class="crumb-slash">/</span><b>{{page==='library'?'Perpustakaan':page==='editor'?'Editor kuis':page==='host'||page==='sessions'?'Sesi langsung':page==='reports'?'Laporan':page==='assignments'?'Tugas mandiri':'Perpustakaan'}}</b></div><div class="top-actions"><button class="icon-btn" aria-label="Notifikasi" @click="ping('Tidak ada notifikasi baru')"><Bell :size="18"/><i></i></button><div class="top-divider"></div><button class="top-profile" @click="openAuth"><span class="profile-avatar small">{{authUser?.email?.slice(0,2).toUpperCase()||'RN'}}</span><ChevronDown :size="15"/></button></div></header>
    <div class="page-content" v-if="page==='library'">
      <section class="welcome-row"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span>RABU, 2 OKTOBER 2026</div><h1>Selamat datang kembali,<br/><em>Rani.</em></h1><p class="welcome-sub">Ide bagus dimulai dari satu pertanyaan.</p></div><div class="welcome-stamp"><div class="stamp-ring"><Sparkles :size="19"/><span>HARI INI<br/>WAKTUNYA</span><b>seru!</b></div><span class="stamp-spark s1">✳</span><span class="stamp-spark s2">✦</span></div></section>
      <section class="quick-actions"><button class="quick-create" @click="makeQuiz"><span class="quick-icon"><Plus :size="20"/></span><span><b>Buat kuis baru</b><small>Mulai dari halaman kosong</small></span><ArrowRight class="quick-arrow" :size="19"/></button><button class="quick-join" @click="nav('join')"><span class="quick-icon join-icon"><Gamepad2 :size="19"/></span><span><b>Gabung sesi</b><small>Masukkan PIN dari pengajar</small></span><ArrowRight class="quick-arrow" :size="19"/></button><button class="quick-template" @click="makeQuiz"><span class="quick-icon template-icon"><Sparkles :size="18"/></span><span><b>Jelajahi inspirasi</b><small>Temukan format yang pas</small></span><ArrowRight class="quick-arrow" :size="19"/></button></section>
      <section class="library-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">MILIKMU, SEPENUHNYA</div><h2>Perpustakaan <span class="title-count">{{quizzes.length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}}</span></h2></div><div class="library-import-actions"><input ref="importInput" type="file" accept=".xlsx,.xls" hidden @change="importQuizExcel"/><button class="outline-button" @click="downloadQuizTemplate"><Download :size="15"/> Template Excel</button><button class="outline-button" @click="importInput?.click()"><FilePlus2 :size="15"/> Import Excel</button></div></div>
        <div class="library-toolbar"><div class="tab-list"><button v-for="t in tabs" :key="t" :class="{selected:activeTab===t}" @click="activeTab=t">{{t}}<span v-if="t==='Semua kuis'" class="tab-num">{{quizzes.length}}</span></button></div><div class="toolbar-controls"><label class="search-box"><Search :size="16"/><input v-model="search" placeholder="Cari kuis..." aria-label="Cari kuis"/><kbd>⌘ K</kbd></label><button class="filter-btn" @click="ping('Filter: semua kategori')"><Filter :size="16"/>Filter</button></div></div>
        <div class="quiz-grid" v-if="filtered.length"><article v-for="(q,i) in filtered" :key="q.id" class="quiz-card"><button class="quiz-art" :class="q.color" @click="editQuiz(q)" :aria-label="'Edit '+q.title"><span class="art-label">{{q.category}}</span><template v-if="i===0"><div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="art-sun"></div><span class="art-asterisk">✳</span><span class="art-number">01</span><span class="art-bottom">PERTANYAAN<br/>MEMBUKA DUNIA</span></template><template v-else-if="i===1"><div class="map-shape"></div><span class="map-pin pin-a">✦</span><span class="map-pin pin-b">●</span><span class="art-bottom">CERITA DARI<br/>KEPULAUAN KITA</span></template><template v-else><div class="shape-cards"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="art-bottom">PEMANASAN<br/>OTAK BERSAMA</span></template><span class="art-open"><ArrowUpRightShim/></span></button><div class="card-info"><div class="card-title-row"><button class="card-title" @click="editQuiz(q)">{{q.title}}</button><button class="more-btn" @click="ping('Opsi kuis')" aria-label="Opsi kuis"><MoreHorizontal :size="18"/></button></div><div class="card-meta"><span><ListChecks :size="14"/>{{q.questions.length}} soal</span><span class="meta-dot">·</span><span>{{q.updated}}</span></div><div class="card-footer"><span class="published"><i></i>{{q.published?'Dipublikasikan':'Draf'}}</span><div class="card-actions"><button title="Mulai sesi" @click="startSession(q)"><Play :size="15"/></button><button title="Edit kuis" @click="editQuiz(q)"><Settings2 :size="15"/></button></div></div></div></article><button class="new-card" @click="makeQuiz"><span class="new-card-plus"><Plus :size="22"/></span><b>Buat sesuatu yang baru</b><small>Kuis, cerita, atau tantangan kecil.</small></button></div>
        <div class="empty-state" v-else><div class="empty-icon"><Search :size="22"/></div><b>Belum ada kuis yang cocok</b><p>Coba kata kunci lain untuk menemukan kuismu.</p><button class="text-btn" @click="search='';activeTab='Semua kuis'">Hapus pencarian</button></div>
        <footer class="page-foot"><span>RUANG KUIS <b>·</b> BELAJAR LEBIH HIDUP</span><span>Dirancang untuk semua orang <span class="heart">♥</span></span></footer>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="page-content editor-page" v-else-if="page==='editor'">
      <div class="editor-top"><button class="back-link" @click="saveDraft();nav('library')"><ArrowLeft :size="16"/> Perpustakaan</button><div class="save-indicator"><span></span>Tersimpan otomatis</div><div class="editor-top-actions"><input ref="importInput" type="file" accept=".xlsx,.xls" hidden @change="importQuizExcel"/><button class="outline-button" @click="downloadQuizTemplate"><Download :size="15"/> Template Excel</button><button class="outline-button" @click="importInput?.click()"><FilePlus2 :size="15"/> Import Excel</button><button class="outline-button" @click="previewQuiz"><Eye :size="16"/> Pratinjau</button><button class="primary-button" @click="publishAndLaunch"><Check :size="16"/> Terbitkan</button></div></div>
      <div class="editor-title-line"><div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">EDITOR KUIS <span class="sep">·</span> DRAF</div><input class="title-input" v-model="editorTitle" aria-label="Judul kuis"/><p class="editor-sub">Simpan rasa ingin tahu dalam beberapa pertanyaan.</p></div><button class="share-lite" @click="ping('Kuis masih berupa draf')"><Share2 :size="16"/> Bagikan</button></div>
      <div class="editor-layout"><aside class="question-rail"><div class="rail-head"><b>ISI KUIS</b><button @click="addQuestion" aria-label="Tambah soal"><Plus :size="16"/></button></div><button v-for="(q,i) in draft" :key="q.id" class="question-item" :class="{current:activeQ===i}" @click="activeQ=i"><span class="question-index">{{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}}</span><span class="question-text-mini">{{q.prompt||'Soal baru'}}</span><MoreHorizontal :size="15"/></button><button class="add-question" @click="addQuestion"><Plus :size="16"/> Tambah soal</button><div class="rail-tip"><Sparkles :size="15"/><span>Tip kecil: satu ide dalam satu pertanyaan membuat kuis lebih mudah diikuti.</span></div></aside>
        <section class="question-canvas" v-if="draft[activeQ]"><div class="canvas-meta"><div class="type-picker-wrap"><button class="question-kind" @click="typeMenu=!typeMenu"><span class="kind-dot"></span>{{draft[activeQ].type}} <ChevronDown :size="14"/></button><div v-if="typeMenu" class="type-menu"><section v-for="group in questionTypeGroups" :key="group.title" class="type-menu-group"><b>{{group.title}}</b><button v-for="kind in group.items" :key="kind.type" @click="setQuestionType(kind)"><span>{{kind.emoji}}</span>{{kind.label}}</button></section></div></div><div class="canvas-tools"><label><Timer :size="15"/><input v-model.number="draft[activeQ].seconds" type="number" min="5" max="240" aria-label="Durasi dalam detik"/> dtk</label><label><input v-model.number="draft[activeQ].points" type="number" min="0" max="10000" aria-label="Skor soal"/> poin</label><button class="delete-q" @click="deleteQuestion" aria-label="Hapus soal" title="Hapus soal"><Trash2 :size="17"/></button></div></div><div class="prompt-card"><span class="prompt-label">{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='slide'?'SLIDE CONTENT':(typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='type_answer'?'TYPE ANSWER':typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='pin_answer'?'PIN ANSWER':typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='drop_pin'?'DROP PIN':'PERTANYAAN '+String(activeQ+1).padStart(2,'0'))}}</span><textarea v-model="draft[activeQ].prompt" :rows="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='slide'?5:2" :placeholder="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='slide'?'Tulis materi yang ingin ditampilkan…':'Apa yang ingin kamu tanyakan?'" aria-label="Teks pertanyaan"></textarea><button class="media-button" @click="ping('Pilih gambar: unggah tersedia setelah Storage dikonfigurasi')"><Image :size="16"/>Tambahkan gambar</button></div><div v-if="['quiz','true_false','multi_select','poll','puzzle'].includes(typeCode(draft[activeQ].type))" class="type-answer-block"><div class="answer-caption"><b>{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='poll'?'OPSI JAWABAN':typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='puzzle'?'URUTAN JAWABAN YANG BENAR':'PILIHAN JAWABAN'}}</b><span>{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='multi_select'?'Tandai semua jawaban benar':typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='puzzle'?'Atur urutan yang harus disusun peserta':typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='poll'?'Peserta memilih satu opsi tanpa skor':'Tandai satu jawaban yang benar'}}</span></div><div class="answer-grid"><div v-for="(opt,j) in draft[activeQ].options" :key="j" class="answer-row" :class="['answer-'+(j%4),{correct:typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='multi_select'?(draft[activeQ].correctIndices||[]).includes(j):draft[activeQ].correct===j}]"><button v-if="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)!=='poll'&&typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)!=='puzzle'" class="answer-mark" @click="markCorrect(j)" :aria-label="'Tandai pilihan '+(j+1)+' benar'">{{(typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='multi_select'?(draft[activeQ].correctIndices||[]).includes(j):draft[activeQ].correct===j)?'✓':''}}</button><span v-if="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='puzzle'" class="order-number">{{j+1}}</span><input v-model="draft[activeQ].options[j]" :aria-label="'Pilihan jawaban '+(j+1)"/><div v-if="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='puzzle'" class="order-controls"><button @click="moveOption(j,-1)" :disabled="j===0" aria-label="Naikkan"><ArrowUp :size="14"/></button><button @click="moveOption(j,1)" :disabled="j===draft[activeQ].options.length-1" aria-label="Turunkan"><ArrowDown :size="14"/></button></div><button v-if="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)!=='true_false'&&typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)!=='puzzle'" class="remove-option" @click="removeOption(j)" aria-label="Hapus pilihan"><Trash2 :size="14"/></button></div></div><button v-if="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)!=='true_false'&&typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)!=='puzzle'" class="add-option" @click="addOption"><Plus :size="15"/> Tambah pilihan</button></div><div v-else-if="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='type_answer'" class="type-special-card"><span class="special-icon">⌨️</span><div><b>KUNCI JAWABAN</b><small>Tulis jawaban yang akan dinilai benar. Huruf besar/kecil tidak dibedakan.</small></div><input v-model="draft[activeQ].options[0]" placeholder="Tulis jawaban benar…" aria-label="Kunci jawaban"/></div><div v-else-if="['slider','scale','nps_scale'].includes(typeCode(draft[activeQ].type))" class="type-special-card scale-builder"><span class="special-icon">📈</span><div><b>{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='nps_scale'?'NPS SCALE':typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='slider'?'SLIDER RANGE':'SCALE RANGE'}}</b><small>{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='nps_scale'?'Peserta memberi nilai rekomendasi dari 0 sampai 10.':'Atur nilai terendah dan tertinggi untuk slider.'}}</small></div><label class="range-bound">Min<input v-model.number="draft[activeQ].minValue" type="number"/></label><input class="builder-range" type="range" :min="draft[activeQ].minValue??0" :max="draft[activeQ].maxValue??10" :value="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='slider'?draft[activeQ].correctValue:((draft[activeQ].minValue??0)+(draft[activeQ].maxValue??10))/2" disabled aria-label="Contoh rentang slider"/><label class="range-bound">Max<input v-model.number="draft[activeQ].maxValue" type="number"/></label><label v-if="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='slider'" class="correct-range-bound">NILAI BENAR<input v-model.number="draft[activeQ].correctValue" type="number" :min="draft[activeQ].minValue??0" :max="draft[activeQ].maxValue??10"/></label></div><div v-else-if="['open_ended','word_cloud','brainstorm'].includes(typeCode(draft[activeQ].type))" class="type-special-card"><span class="special-icon">{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='word_cloud'?'☁️':typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='brainstorm'?'💡':'💬'}}</span><div><b>{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='word_cloud'?'WORD CLOUD':typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='brainstorm'?'BRAINSTORM':'OPEN-ENDED'}}</b><small>{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='word_cloud'?'Jawaban satu kata dikumpulkan untuk membentuk awan kata.':typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='brainstorm'?'Peserta mengirim ide untuk dikumpulkan bersama.':'Peserta menulis tanggapan bebas tanpa penilaian otomatis.'}}</small></div></div><div v-else-if="['pin_answer','drop_pin'].includes(typeCode(draft[activeQ].type))" class="pin-builder"><div class="pin-builder-copy"><b>{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='pin_answer'?'PIN ANSWER':'DROP PIN'}}</b><small>{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='pin_answer'?'Klik peta untuk memilih lokasi jawaban benar.':'Peserta akan menandai lokasi pilihan mereka.'}}</small></div><div class="map-board" @click="typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='pin_answer'&&setMapTarget($event)" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Pilih titik jawaban pada peta"><div class="map-land land-a"></div><div class="map-land land-b"></div><div class="map-river"></div><span v-if="draft[activeQ].target" class="map-marker" :style="{left:((draft[activeQ].target?.x??.5)*100)+'%',top:((draft[activeQ].target?.y??.5)*100)+'%'}">📍</span><small>{{typeCode(draft[activeQ].type)==='pin_answer'?'KLIK UNTUK MENANDAI JAWABAN BENAR':'PETA UNTUK LOKASI PESERTA'}}</small></div></div><div v-else class="type-special-card slide-builder"><span class="special-icon">📖</span><div><b>SLIDE MATERI</b><small>Slide ditampilkan kepada peserta. Pengajar mengatur kapan lanjut ke soal berikutnya.</small></div></div><div class="canvas-footer"><span><CircleHelp :size="15"/> Pilih jawaban benar sebelum diterbitkan.</span><button @click="addQuestion">Soal berikutnya <ArrowRight :size="15"/></button></div></section><aside class="properties-panel"><div class="prop-title"><b>DETAIL KUIS</b><button @click="ping('Pengaturan kuis')"><Settings2 :size="16"/></button></div><label class="field-label">DESKRIPSI<textarea placeholder="Apa yang akan dipelajari?" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="field-label">BAHASA<select><option>Bahasa Indonesia</option><option>English</option></select></label><label class="field-label">KATEGORI<select><option>Umum</option><option>Sains</option><option>Geografi</option></select></label><div class="visibility-box"><LockKeyhole :size="16"/><span><b>Pribadi</b><small>Hanya kamu yang bisa melihat</small></span><ChevronDown :size="15"/></div><div class="property-note"><Sparkles :size="16"/><p>Setiap soal tersimpan dalam draf. Versi terbitan menjadi salinan tetap untuk sesi permainan.</p></div></aside></div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-content editor-page preview-page" v-else-if="page==='preview'"><div class="editor-top"><button class="back-link" @click="nav('editor')"><ArrowLeft :size="16"/> Kembali ke editor</button><div class="save-indicator"><Eye :size="14"/> Pratinjau peserta</div><button class="primary-button" @click="publishAndLaunch"><Play :size="16"/> Terbitkan & luncurkan</button></div><section class="preview-card"><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">{{currentQuiz.title}} · SOAL {{activeQ+1}} DARI {{draft.length}}</div><div class="preview-progress"><i :style="{width:((activeQ+1)/draft.length*100)+'%'}"></i></div><span class="preview-kind">{{draft[activeQ]?.type}}</span><h1>{{draft[activeQ]?.prompt}}</h1><div class="preview-answers"><template v-if="['Quiz','True or false','Poll','Puzzle'].includes(draft[activeQ]?.type||'')"><button v-for="(option,i) in draft[activeQ]?.options" :key="i"><span>{{['▲','◆','●','■'][i%4]}}</span>{{option}}</button></template><div v-else-if="['Slider','Scale','NPS scale'].includes(draft[activeQ]?.type||'')" class="preview-range"><span>{{draft[activeQ]?.minValue}}</span><input type="range" :min="draft[activeQ]?.minValue" :max="draft[activeQ]?.maxValue" disabled/><span>{{draft[activeQ]?.maxValue}}</span></div><div v-else-if="['Pin answer','Drop pin'].includes(draft[activeQ]?.type||'')" class="preview-open-answer">📍 Peserta akan menandai lokasi pada peta</div><div v-else-if="draft[activeQ]?.type==='Type answer'" class="preview-open-answer">⌨️ Peserta akan mengetik jawaban singkat</div><div v-else-if="draft[activeQ]?.type==='Slide content'" class="preview-open-answer">Materi slide tampil kepada peserta</div><div v-else class="preview-open-answer">{{draft[activeQ]?.type==='Word cloud'?'Jawaban satu kata dihimpun menjadi word cloud':draft[activeQ]?.type==='Brainstorm'?'Ide peserta dikumpulkan bersama':'Peserta menulis tanggapan mereka'}}</div></div><div class="preview-bottom"><span><Timer :size="15"/> {{draft[activeQ]?.seconds}} detik <b>·</b> {{draft[activeQ]?.points}} poin</span><div><button class="outline-button" @click="activeQ=Math.max(0,activeQ-1)" :disabled="activeQ===0"><ArrowLeft :size="15"/></button><button class="primary-button" @click="activeQ=Math.min(draft.length-1,activeQ+1)" :disabled="activeQ===draft.length-1">Berikutnya <ArrowRight :size="15"/></button></div></div></section></div>
    <div class="page-content reports-page sessions-page" v-else-if="page==='sessions'"><div class="reports-head"><div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">RUANG BELAJAR · LIVE</div><h1>Sesi langsung</h1><p>Luncurkan kuis dan bagikan PIN kepada peserta.</p></div><button class="primary-button" @click="nav('library')"><Grid2X2 :size="16"/> Pilih kuis</button></div><section v-if="session?.remote" class="active-session-card"><div class="active-session-symbol"><Gamepad2 :size="22"/></div><div><span class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">SESI AKTIF</span><h2>{{remoteQuizTitle||currentQuiz.title}}</h2><p>Kode akses <strong>{{session.pin}}</strong> · {{remoteParticipantCount}} peserta bergabung</p></div><button class="primary-button" @click="nav('host')">Buka ruang tunggu <ArrowRight :size="16"/></button></section><section class="session-launch-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">SIAP DIMAINKAN</div><h2>Pilih kuis untuk diluncurkan</h2></div></div><div class="launch-quiz-list"><article v-for="quiz in quizzes" :key="quiz.id" class="launch-quiz-row"><span class="launch-quiz-mark"><ListChecks :size="18"/></span><div><b>{{quiz.title}}</b><small>{{quiz.questions.length}} soal · {{quiz.published?'Sudah diterbitkan':'Draf'}}</small></div><button class="outline-button" @click="startSession(quiz)"><Play :size="15"/> Buat PIN</button></article></div></section></div>
    <div class="page-content host-page" v-else-if="page==='host'">
      <div class="host-title"><div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">SESI LANGSUNG <span class="sep">·</span> {{livePhase==='lobby'?'LOBI':livePhase==='podium'?'SELESAI':'SEDANG BERLANGSUNG'}}</div><h1>{{livePhase==='lobby'?'Ruang tunggu':livePhase==='podium'?'Kuis selesai!':'Pertanyaan sedang dimainkan'}}</h1><p>{{currentQuiz.title}} <span class="sep">·</span> Dibuat oleh Rani Nugraha</p></div><div class="host-head-actions"><button v-if="!isHostFullscreen" class="outline-button" @click="nav('reports')"><BarChart3 :size="16"/> Lihat laporan</button><button class="outline-button fullscreen-toggle" @click="toggleHostFullscreen"><Minimize v-if="isHostFullscreen" :size="16"/><Maximize v-else :size="16"/> {{isHostFullscreen?'Keluar layar penuh':'Layar penuh'}}</button></div></div>
      <div v-if="livePhase==='lobby'" class="lobby-layout"><section class="lobby-main"><div class="pin-panel"><div class="pin-label"><span class="live-dot"></span> PIN UNTUK BERGABUNG</div><div class="pin-value">{{session?.pin||'— — — — — —'}}</div><div class="pin-bottom"><button @click="copyPin"><Copy :size="15"/> Salin PIN</button><button type="button" @click="openSessionQr"><QrCode :size="17"/> Tampilkan QR</button></div><div class="pin-decoration">✳</div></div><div v-if="qrDataUrl" class="host-qr-inline"><img :src="qrDataUrl" alt="QR kode akses kuis"/><div><span class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">PIN · {{session?.pin}}</span><b>Pindai untuk bergabung</b><small>Kode akses akan terisi otomatis.</small><button class="text-btn" @click="openSessionQr">Perbesar QR <ArrowRight :size="14"/></button></div></div><div class="lobby-control"><div><b>Siap memulai?</b><p>Mulai saat peserta sudah masuk ke ruang tunggu.</p></div><button class="primary-button start-button" @click="startGame"><Play :size="17" fill="currentColor"/> Mulai permainan</button></div></section><aside class="players-panel"><div class="players-head"><div><b>Peserta bergabung</b><small>{{remoteSession?participants.length:participants.length-1}} pemain menunggu</small></div><span class="player-count">{{remoteSession?remoteParticipantCount:(participants.length===5?'22':participants.length)}}<Users :size="15"/></span></div><div class="player-list"><div v-for="(p,i) in participants" :key="p" class="player-row"><span class="player-avatar" :class="'pa-'+i">{{participantAvatars[p]||'🦊'}}</span><b>{{p}}</b><span v-if="i<4" class="joined-tag">BERGABUNG</span></div></div><button class="lobby-link" @click="copyInviteLink"><Share2 :size="15"/> Bagikan tautan undangan</button><div class="lobby-option"><span><LockKeyhole :size="15"/> Kunci ruang tunggu</span><button class="switch" :class="{on:locked}" @click="locked=!locked"><i></i></button></div></aside></div>
      <div v-else-if="livePhase==='question'||livePhase==='reveal'" class="host-game"><div class="game-topline"><span>PERTANYAAN {{String(currentQ+1).padStart(2,'0')}} / {{String(remoteSession?remoteQuestionCount:currentQuiz.questions.length).padStart(2,'0')}}</span><span class="game-timer" :class="{urgent:secs<6}"><Timer :size="18"/> 00:{{String(secs).padStart(2,'0')}}</span><span>{{remoteSession?remoteParticipantCount:(participants.length===5?'22':participants.length)}} PEMAIN</span></div><div class="host-question"><div class="host-q-label">{{activeQuestion?.type}}</div><h2>{{activeQuestion?.prompt}}</h2></div><div v-if="['Pin answer','Drop pin'].includes(activeQuestion?.type||'')" class="host-pin-map"><div class="map-board"><div class="map-land land-a"></div><div class="map-land land-b"></div><div class="map-river"></div><span v-if="livePhase==='reveal'&&activeQuestion?.target" class="map-marker" :style="{left:(activeQuestion.target.x*100)+'%',top:(activeQuestion.target.y*100)+'%'}">📍</span><small>{{livePhase==='reveal'?'LOKASI JAWABAN':'JAWABAN LOKASI PESERTA'}}</small></div></div><div v-else-if="['Slider','Scale','NPS scale'].includes(activeQuestion?.type||'')" class="host-scale"><span>{{activeQuestion?.minValue??0}}</span><div><i></i><b v-if="livePhase==='reveal'&&activeQuestion?.type==='Slider'" :style="{left:((((activeQuestion.correctValue??0)-(activeQuestion.minValue??0))/((activeQuestion.maxValue??100)-(activeQuestion.minValue??0)))*100)+'%'}"></b></div><span>{{livePhase==='reveal'&&activeQuestion?.type==='Slider'?activeQuestion.correctValue:activeQuestion?.maxValue??10}}</span></div><div v-else-if="['Type answer','Open-ended','Word cloud','Brainstorm'].includes(activeQuestion?.type||'')" class="host-response-hint">{{activeQuestion?.type==='Type answer'?'Peserta mengetik jawaban':activeQuestion?.type==='Word cloud'?'Jawaban satu kata akan dikumpulkan':'Ide peserta akan muncul dalam hasil sesi'}}</div><div v-else class="host-options"><div v-for="(o,i) in activeQuestion?.options" :key="o" class="host-option" :class="['ho-'+i,{'host-correct':livePhase==='reveal'&&i===activeQuestion?.correct}]"><span class="option-shape">{{['▲','◆','●','■'][i]}}</span>{{o}}<span v-if="livePhase==='reveal'&&i===activeQuestion?.correct" class="correct-label"><Check :size="15"/> Jawaban benar</span></div></div><section v-if="scoreRows.length" class="host-live-score-strip"><header><b>SKOR LIVE</b><small>TERBARU</small></header><div class="live-score-list"><article v-for="(p,i) in scoreRows.slice(0,5)" :key="p.name"><span class="live-score-rank">{{i+1}}</span><span class="live-score-avatar">{{p.avatar||participantAvatars[p.name]||'🦊'}}</span><span class="winner-avatar">{{p.avatar||participantAvatars[p.name]||'🦊'}}</span><b>{{p.name}}</b><strong>{{p.score.toLocaleString('id-ID')}}</strong></article></div></section><div class="host-game-footer"><span v-if="livePhase==='question'"><span class="live-dot"></span> Menunggu jawaban <b>{{remoteSession?participants.length+' bergabung':'14 / 22'}}</b></span><span v-else><Check :size="16"/> Jawaban ditampilkan ke peserta</span><button class="primary-button" @click="livePhase==='question'?lockAnswer():nextQuestion()">{{livePhase==='question'?'Tampilkan jawaban':currentQ===(remoteSession?remoteQuestionCount:currentQuiz.questions.length)-1?'Lihat podium':'Soal berikutnya'}} <ArrowRight :size="16"/></button></div></div>
      <div v-else class="podium-panel"><div class="podium-confetti">✳　✦　✳</div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">SEMUA JAWABAN SUDAH MASUK</div><h2>Hebat sekali,<br/><em>semua pemain!</em></h2><div class="podium-winners"><div v-for="(p,i) in scoreRows.slice(0,3)" :key="p.name" class="winner" :class="'winner-'+i"><span class="winner-medal">{{i===0?'✦':i===1?'✧':'✦'}}</span><b>{{p.name}}</b><strong>{{p.score.toLocaleString('id-ID')}}</strong><small>{{i===0?'JUARA 1':i===1?'JUARA 2':'JUARA 3'}}</small></div></div><div class="podium-actions"><button class="outline-button" @click="nav('reports')"><BarChart3 :size="16"/> Buka laporan</button><button class="primary-button" @click="startSession(currentQuiz)"><Play :size="16"/> Mainkan lagi</button></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-content join-page" v-else-if="page==='join'">
      <div class="join-card"><div class="join-mark"><span>✳</span></div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">RUANG KUIS <span class="sep">·</span> GABUNG PERMAINAN</div><h1>Sudah siap<br/>bermain?</h1><p>Masukkan PIN sesi dari pengajarmu untuk langsung bergabung.</p><label class="join-label">PIN PERMAINAN<input v-model="joinPin" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="8" placeholder="Contoh: 12345678"/></label><label class="join-label">NAMAMU DI PERMAINAN<input v-model="playerName" maxlength="24" placeholder="Nama panggilan (opsional)"/></label><div class="avatar-picker"><span>PILIH AVATAR</span><button v-for="avatar in avatars" :key="avatar" :class="{chosen:playerAvatar===avatar}" @click="playerAvatar=avatar">{{avatar}}</button></div><small v-if="joinError" class="join-error">{{joinError}}</small><button class="primary-button join-submit" @click="joinGame">Masuk ke ruang tunggu <ArrowRight :size="16"/></button><small class="privacy-note"><LockKeyhole :size="13"/> Tidak perlu akun. Namamu hanya terlihat di sesi ini.</small><button class="back-link join-back" @click="nav('library')"><ArrowLeft :size="15"/> Kembali ke perpustakaan</button></div><div class="join-side-art"><div class="join-art-circle"><span>?</span><i>✳</i><b>IKUTI<br/>RASA<br/>INGIN TAHU</b></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-content player-page" v-else-if="page==='player'"><div class="player-top"><span class="brand"><span class="brand-mark"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>ruang<span class="brand-bold">kuis</span><span class="player-brand-avatar">{{playerAvatar}}</span></span><span class="player-rank"><Trophy :size="16"/> {{(scoreRows.find((p:any)=>p.name===playerName)?.score||0).toLocaleString('id-ID')}} poin</span></div><section v-if="livePhase==='podium'" class="public-podium"><div class="public-podium-heading"><span class="podium-player-avatar">{{playerAvatar}}</span><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">PERMAINAN SELESAI · PODIUM</div><h1>{{playerPlacement?`Kamu di peringkat ${playerPlacement}`:'Kuis selesai!'}}</h1><p>{{playerName}}, kamu mengumpulkan <b>{{(scoreRows.find((p:any)=>p.name===playerName)?.score||0).toLocaleString('id-ID')}} poin</b>.</p></div><div class="public-podium-stage"><article v-for="(p,i) in podiumLeaders" :key="p.name" class="public-podium-player" :class="['place-'+(i+1),{'is-you':p.name===playerName}]"><span class="public-podium-avatar">{{p.avatar||participantAvatars[p.name]||'🦊'}}</span><b>{{p.name}}</b><strong>{{p.score.toLocaleString('id-ID')}}</strong><small>{{i===0?'JUARA 1':i===1?'JUARA 2':'JUARA 3'}}</small></article></div><div v-if="playerPlacement>3" class="public-placement-note"><span>{{playerAvatar}}</span><b>{{playerName}}</b><strong>#{{playerPlacement}}</strong><small>DARI {{scoreRows.length}} PEMAIN</small></div><button class="outline-button" @click="nav('landing')">Selesai</button></section><div v-else-if="!activeQuestion" class="waiting-card"><span class="wait-symbol">✳</span><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">KAMU SUDAH MASUK</div><h1>Hai, {{playerName}}!</h1><p>Tunggu sebentar, permainan akan segera dimulai.</p><span class="waiting-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div><div v-else class="player-question"><div class="player-session-line"><span>{{currentQuiz.title}}</span><span>SOAL {{currentQ+1}} / {{currentQuiz.questions.length}}</span></div><div class="player-timer"><span :style="{width:Math.max(0,secs/(activeQuestion.seconds||20)*100)+'%'}"></span></div><div v-if="livePhase==='reveal'||submitted" class="player-feedback"><span class="feedback-symbol">{{answerChoice===activeQuestion.correct?'✓':'↗'}}</span><div><b>{{answerChoice===activeQuestion.correct?'Tepat sekali!':'Jawaban sudah dicatat'}}</b><small>{{answerChoice===activeQuestion.correct?'Kamu mendapat poin.':'Lihat jawaban yang benar di layar.'}}</small></div><strong>{{(scoreRows.find((p:any)=>p.name===playerName)?.score||0).toLocaleString('id-ID')}}<small>POIN</small></strong></div><div class="player-prompt"><span class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">{{playerName}} <span class="sep">·</span> PILIH JAWABANMU</span><h1>{{activeQuestion.prompt}}</h1><p>{{questionInstructions(activeQuestion.type)}}</p></div><div v-if="['Pin answer','Drop pin'].includes(activeQuestion.type)" class="pin-player"><div class="map-board player-map" @click="setMapTarget($event,true)" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Tandai lokasi"><div class="map-land land-a"></div><div class="map-land land-b"></div><div class="map-river"></div><span v-if="playerMapAnswer" class="map-marker" :style="{left:(playerMapAnswer.x*100)+'%',top:(playerMapAnswer.y*100)+'%'}">📍</span><small>{{playerMapAnswer?'LOKASI DIPILIH':'KETUK PETA UNTUK MENANDAI'}}</small></div><button class="primary-button" @click="playerMapAnswer&&doAnswer(playerMapAnswer)" :disabled="submitted||!playerMapAnswer">Kirim lokasi <ArrowRight :size="16"/></button></div><div v-if="['Slider','Scale','NPS scale'].includes(activeQuestion.type)" class="scale-answer"><div><span>{{activeQuestion.minValue??0}}</span><strong>{{scaleValue}}</strong><span>{{activeQuestion.maxValue??10}}</span></div><input v-model.number="scaleValue" type="range" :min="activeQuestion.minValue??0" :max="activeQuestion.maxValue??10" :disabled="submitted" aria-label="Pilih nilai skala"/><button class="primary-button" @click="doAnswer(scaleValue)" :disabled="submitted">Kirim nilai <ArrowRight :size="16"/></button></div><form v-if="['Type answer','Open-ended','Word cloud','Brainstorm'].includes(activeQuestion.type)" class="player-text-answer" @submit.prevent="doAnswer(typedAnswer)"><textarea v-model="typedAnswer" :placeholder="activeQuestion.type==='Type answer'?'Type your answer…':activeQuestion.type==='Word cloud'?'Enter one word…':'Share your idea…'" :disabled="submitted"></textarea><button class="primary-button" :disabled="submitted">Kirim jawaban <ArrowRight :size="16"/></button></form><div class="player-answers"><button v-for="(o,i) in activeQuestion.options" :key="o" class="player-answer" :class="['pa-answer-'+i,{chosen:answerChoice===i||selectedAnswers.includes(i),correct:submitted&&i===activeQuestion.correct,wrong:submitted&&answerChoice===i&&i!==activeQuestion.correct}]" @click="activeQuestion.type==='Puzzle'?selectComplex(i):doAnswer(i)" :disabled="submitted||livePhase==='reveal'"><span>{{['▲','◆','●','■'][i]}}</span>{{o}}<Check v-if="submitted&&i===activeQuestion.correct" :size="19"/></button><button v-if="activeQuestion.type==='Puzzle'" class="primary-button complex-submit" @click="doAnswer([...selectedAnswers])" :disabled="submitted||!selectedAnswers.length">Kirim pilihan <ArrowRight :size="16"/></button></div><div class="player-safe"><LockKeyhole :size="13"/> {{submitted?'Jawabanmu sudah tersimpan dengan aman.':'Kirim satu jawaban sebelum waktunya habis.'}}</div></div></div>
    <div class="page-content reports-page" v-else-if="page==='reports'"><div class="reports-head"><div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">APA YANG KITA PELAJARI</div><h1>Laporan & hasil</h1><p>Lihat bagaimana peserta mengikuti setiap sesi.</p></div><button class="primary-button" @click="exportCsv"><Download :size="16"/> Ekspor CSV</button></div><div class="report-stats"><div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-icon mint-icon"><Gamepad2 :size="18"/></span><small>TOTAL SESI</small><b>12</b><span class="stat-note">+3 bulan ini</span></div><div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-icon peach-icon"><Users :size="18"/></span><small>PESERTA</small><b>248</b><span class="stat-note">di semua sesi</span></div><div class="stat-card"><span class="stat-icon lavender-icon"><Activity :size="18"/></span><small>RATA-RATA JAWABAN BENAR</small><b>76<span>%</span></b><span class="stat-note">+8% dari bulan lalu</span></div></div><section class="report-detail"><div class="report-detail-head"><div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">SESI TERAKHIR</div><h2>Hasil peserta</h2></div><button class="filter-btn" @click="ping('Menampilkan semua sesi')"><Filter :size="15"/> Semua sesi</button></div><div class="report-session-meta"><div class="report-cover mint"><span class="tiny-asterisk">✳</span></div><span><b>{{currentQuiz.title}}</b><small>2 Okt 2026 <i>·</i> 22 peserta <i>·</i> {{remoteSession?remoteQuestionCount:currentQuiz.questions.length}} pertanyaan</small></span><span class="report-session-status"><i></i> Selesai</span><button class="more-btn" @click="ping('Detail laporan')"><MoreHorizontal :size="19"/></button></div><div class="report-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>PERINGKAT</th><th>NAMA PEMAIN</th><th>JAWABAN BENAR</th><th>SKOR AKHIR</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(p,i) in [...scoreRows].sort((a:any,b:any)=>b.score-a.score)" :key="p.name"><td><span class="rank-pill" :class="{first:i===0}">{{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}}</span></td><td><span class="table-avatar" :class="'pa-'+i">{{p.name[0]}}</span><b>{{p.name}}</b></td><td><span class="correct-metric">{{p.correct}} / {{remoteSession?remoteQuestionCount:currentQuiz.questions.length}}</span><div class="mini-progress"><i :style="{width:(p.correct/(remoteSession?remoteQuestionCount:currentQuiz.questions.length)*100)+'%'}"></i></div></td><td><b>{{p.score.toLocaleString('id-ID')}}</b> <small>poin</small></td><td><button class="more-btn" @click="ping('Detail peserta')"><MoreHorizontal :size="18"/></button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="report-foot"><span>Skor dihitung dari ketepatan dan waktu menjawab.</span><button class="text-btn" @click="exportCsv">Unduh semua hasil <ArrowRight :size="14"/></button></div></section></div>
    <div class="page-content reports-page" v-else><div class="reports-head"><div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">BELAJAR KAPAN SAJA</div><h1>Tugas mandiri</h1><p>Buat aktivitas yang bisa dikerjakan peserta sesuai waktu mereka.</p></div><button class="primary-button" @click="ping('Pilih kuis yang ingin dibagikan')"><Plus :size="16"/> Buat tugas</button></div><div class="assignment-empty"><div class="empty-icon"><BookOpen :size="22"/></div><h2>Waktunya belajar dengan ritme sendiri</h2><p>Tugas yang dibagikan akan muncul di sini. Pilih kuis dari perpustakaan untuk membuat tugas pertama.</p><button class="primary-button" @click="nav('library')">Pilih kuis <ArrowRight :size="16"/></button></div></div>
    <div v-if="qrOpen" class="modal-scrim qr-scrim" @click.self="qrOpen=false"><section class="qr-modal"><button class="modal-close" aria-label="Tutup QR" @click="qrOpen=false"><X :size="18"/></button><span class="qr-modal-icon"><QrCode :size="22"/></span><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">KODE AKSES · {{session?.pin}}</div><h2>Pindai untuk bergabung</h2><p>Kode kuis sudah terisi otomatis setelah tautan dibuka.</p><img class="session-qr-image" :src="qrDataUrl" alt="QR code untuk bergabung ke sesi kuis"/><code>{{qrUrl}}</code><small v-if="qrLocalOnly" class="qr-local-note">Alamat localhost hanya dapat dibuka dari perangkat host. Atur VITE_PUBLIC_APP_URL ke domain atau alamat jaringan yang dapat dijangkau peserta.</small><button class="outline-button qr-copy-button" @click="copyInviteLink"><Copy :size="15"/> Salin tautan peserta</button></section></div>
    <div v-if="modal==='auth'||modal==='account'" class="modal-scrim" @click.self="modal=''"><section class="auth-modal"><button class="modal-close" aria-label="Tutup" @click="modal=''"><X :size="18"/></button><template v-if="modal==='account'"><div class="join-mark"><span>✳</span></div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">AKUN RUANG KUIS</div><h2>Akunmu tersambung</h2><p class="auth-copy">{{authUser?.email}}</p><button class="primary-button auth-submit" @click="signOut"><LogOut :size="16"/> Keluar</button></template><template v-else><div class="join-mark"><span>✳</span></div><div class="eyebrow section-eyebrow">RUANG KUIS <span class="sep">·</span> AKUN</div><h2>{{authMode==='signin'?'Selamat datang kembali':'Buat akun pengajar'}}</h2><p class="auth-copy">Simpan kuis dan kelola sesi dari perangkat mana pun.</p><label v-if="authMode==='signup'" class="join-label">NAMA PENGAJAR<input v-model="authDisplayName" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Namamu"/></label><label class="join-label">EMAIL<input v-model="authEmail" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="nama@email.com"/></label><label class="join-label">KATA SANDI<input v-model="authPassword" type="password" :autocomplete="authMode==='signup'?'new-password':'current-password'" placeholder="Minimal 8 karakter"/></label><button class="primary-button auth-submit" :disabled="authBusy" @click="submitAuth">{{authBusy?'Memproses…':authMode==='signin'?'Masuk':'Daftar'}}</button><button class="text-btn auth-switch" @click="authMode=authMode==='signin'?'signup':'signin'">{{authMode==='signin'?'Belum punya akun? Daftar':'Sudah punya akun? Masuk'}}</button><small class="privacy-note"><LockKeyhole :size="13"/> Akun dikelola aman melalui Supabase Auth.</small></template></section></div>

    <div v-if="toast" class="toast"><Check :size="16"/>{{toast}}</div>
  </main>
</div>
